msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3C079421_56E1_4F15_93A3_DA796E86F4D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
